                        <p>Preventive care to help protect pets from parasites and disease.</p>
                        <a href="#prices" data-price-jump="vaccination">Details</a>
                    </article>
                    <article class="medivet-photo-card">
                        <img src="~/images/site/services-7.jfif" asp-append-version="true" alt="Confinement service" />
                        <h3>Confinement</h3>
